==Battleground==
*1 [[Dogenstein]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Calamary|Calamaries]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage introduces Dogenstein, a [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Doge]] that has more health than a 200% [[Wild Doge]] but much less damage, as well a 35% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]]. While the freeze may seem scary, his short range allows for you to just use meatshields to take the freeze as opposed to your attackers. The stage itself is a mix of [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies, but overall isn't too difficult. [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] can deal with both the Dogensteins and the Dober P.D, while [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] can freeze the Calamary to prevent your units from being [[Weaken|weakened]]. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can be very helpful for every enemy in the stage.

==Trivia==
*As the first stage to take place in a [[Media:Map042.png|rearranged North and South America]], Permission to Land has three potential references to American culture:
**Permission to Land's Japanese name, Jiyū e no Jōriku-chi (自由への上陸地, "Landing Point to Freedom"), mentions freedom and may specifically reference "Land of the Free", a phrase in "[[wikipedia:The Star-Spangled Banner|The Star-Spangled Banner]]" commonly used as a nickname for the U.S.
**The enemy base has an eagle on it.
**[[Dogenstein]] resembles [[wikipedia:Albert Einstein|Albert Einstein]], who spent the last 22 years of his life in the U.S.

